<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure — Motiva Hub" description="Motiva Hub affiliate disclosure.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 20, 2026</p>
      <p>
        Motiva Hub participates in affiliate programs, including the Amazon Associates Program.
        This means that some of the "View Book" buttons on our Books page may contain affiliate links.
      </p>
      <h2>What This Means for You</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>If you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission.</li>
        <li>This costs you nothing extra — the price you pay is the same.</li>
        <li>We only recommend books we have actually read and return to.</li>
        <li>We never let commissions influence our recommendations.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Transparency</h2>
      <p>
        We believe in full transparency. As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases.
        If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships, contact us through the
        <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>